#: kamera.cpp:95
msgid "Unable to initialize the gPhoto2 libraries."
msgstr "無法初始化 gPhoto2 程式庫。"

#: kamera.cpp:126
msgid "Click this button to add a new camera."
msgstr "請點選這個按鈕新增照相機。"

#: kamera.cpp:129
msgid "Test"
msgstr "測試"

#: kamera.cpp:130 kamera.cpp:133
msgid "Click this button to remove the selected camera from the list."
msgstr "請點選這個按鈕刪除清單上所選的照相機。"

#: kamera.cpp:135
msgid "Configure..."
msgstr "設定..."

#: kamera.cpp:136
msgid ""
"Click this button to change the configuration of the selected camera."
"<br>"
"<br>The availability of this feature and the contents of the Configuration "
"dialog depend on the camera model."
msgstr "點選這個按鈕來變更所選照相機的設定。<br><br>有沒有這個功能，以及設定方塊內顯示的內容，會依不同照相機型號而有所不同。"

#: kamera.cpp:139
msgid ""
"Click this button to view a summary of the current status of the selected "
"camera."
"<br>"
"<br>The availability of this feature and the contents of the Configuration "
"dialog depend on the camera model."
msgstr "點選這個按鈕來檢視所選照相機的當前狀態摘要。<br><br>有沒有這個功能，以及設定方塊內顯示的內容，會依不同照相機型號而有所不同。"

#: kamera.cpp:143
msgid "Click this button to cancel the current camera operation."
msgstr "請點選這個按鈕取消當前照相機的操作。"

#: kamera.cpp:319
msgid "Camera test was successful."
msgstr "照相機測試成功。"

#: kamera.cpp:400
msgid ""
"<h1>Digital Camera</h1>\n"
"This module allows you to configure support for your digital camera.\n"
"You would need to select the camera's model and the port it is connected\n"
"to on your computer (e.g. USB, Serial, Firewire). If your camera doesn't\n"
"appear in the list of <i>Supported Cameras</i>, go to the\n"
"<a href=\"http://www.gphoto.org\">GPhoto web site</a> for a possible update."
"<br>"
"<br>\n"
"To view and download images from the digital camera, go to address\n"
"<a href=\"camera:/\">camera:/</a> in Konqueror and other KDE applications."
msgstr ""
"<h1>數碼相機</h1>\n"
"這個模組讓您設定數碼相機支援。\n"
"您要指定連接到你的電腦的相機型號與所連結的連接位置 (比方 USB 、序列埠、Firewire 等)。若是您的相機型號沒有列在<i>支援的照相機</i>"
"清單中的話，請連線到\n"
"<a href=\"http://www.gphoto.org\">GPhoto 網站</a> 來取得相關更新。"
"<br>"
"<br>\n"
"要從數碼相機檢視及下載圖像，請在 Konqueror 或其他 KDE 程式上連結\n"
"<a href=\"camera:/\">camera:/</a> 。"

#: kameradevice.cpp:79
msgid "Could not allocate memory for abilities list."
msgstr "無法分配用於功能清單的記憶體。"

#: kameradevice.cpp:83
msgid "Could not load ability list."
msgstr "無法載入功能清單。"

#: kameradevice.cpp:88 kameradevice.cpp:431 kameradevice.cpp:451
msgid ""
"Description of abilities for camera %1 is not available. Configuration options "
"may be incorrect."
msgstr "無法取得 %1 照相機的功能說明。設定選項可能不正確。"

#: kameradevice.cpp:111
msgid "Could not access driver. Check your gPhoto2 installation."
msgstr "無法存取驅動程式。請檢查您的 gPhoto2 軟件安裝是否正確。"

#: kameradevice.cpp:131
msgid ""
"Unable to initialize camera. Check your port settings and camera connectivity "
"and try again."
msgstr "無法對照相機進行初始化的動作。請檢查您的通訊埠設置，以及照相機是否已連接妥當，然後再試。"

#: kameradevice.cpp:155
msgid ""
"No camera summary information is available.\n"
msgstr ""
"無法取得照相機的摘要資訊。\n"

#: kameradevice.cpp:168 kameradevice.cpp:178
msgid "Camera configuration failed."
msgstr "照相機設定失敗。"

